            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azohagarara, aragire umukuku wiwe mu nkomezi z’Uhoraho, no mu cubahiro c’ izina ry’Uhoraho Imana yiwe: kandi bazokwībērah’ umugaramango; kukw ico gihe ubukuru bgiwe buzoshika ku mpera z’isi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
